{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-10-28 02:30:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE ANNOUNCES GO-LIVE OF GLOBAL PROXY SUB-CUSTODY SERVICES IN SWITZERLAND', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LONDON, OCT. 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AS PART OF THE ONGOING WORLDWIDE ROLLOUT OF ITS INNOVATION PROGRAM TO PROMOTE AND ENABLE THE HIGHEST STANDARDS OF CORPORATE GOVERNANCE IN LOCAL AND GLOBAL MARKETS,\xa0 BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE:BR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LIVE OPERATIONAL AVAILABILITY OF ITS "GOLDEN COPY" EVENT SOURCING AND PROXY VOTE EXECUTION SERVICE FOR CUSTODIANS AND LOCAL AGENTS IN SWITZERLAND. THE SWISS SERVICE IS THE LATEST MARKET-READY ADDITION TO BROADRIDGE\'S FAST-GROWING SUB-CUSTODY DIRECT MARKET SOLUTIONS (DMS) PRODUCT SUITE THAT CAN DIRECTLY CONNECT INVESTORS AND ISSUERS.'}